
Important Docker Note (CRITICAL)
=============================
Inside Docker:
spring.config.import=optional:configserver:http://config-service:8888
✔️ config-service works only if containers share the same Docker network

Correct way (recommended):
docker network create micro-net

docker run -d --network micro-net --name config-service config-server
docker run -d --network micro-net --name discovery discovery


❌ Without shared network → discovery cannot reach config-server



✅ 2️⃣ Verify Eureka UI Loads Correctly

Open browser:

http://localhost:8761

Expected Result

Eureka Dashboard opens

“Instances currently registered with Eureka” is empty (initially)

You see:

DS Replicas:


✔️ This means Eureka Server started correctly
✔️ No crash due to config issues


**************************************************************************
✅ 6️⃣ Docker-Level Verification (IMPORTANT)
Check container network name resolution
docker exec -it discovery ping config-service


✔️ If ping works → Docker DNS is correct

***************************************************************************








docker run -d --name discovery -p 8761:8761 discovery

        vs
docker run -p 8761:8761 config-server